{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年72歲的國際巨星成龍，在荷里活以至世界知名度極高，演藝圈地位舉足輕重。近年他將工作重心移回內地，密密出席不同電影宣傳活動和社交場合，所到之處均深受影迷愛戴。成龍身為練武之人，年過70身形依然Keep得Fit爆，不時被稱讚精神狀態保持得比同齡人佳。成龍近日分享一段生活日常片段，片中他大啖油膩煎炸嘢，絲毫不戒口，難掩眼皮浮腫。</p><figure><img alt=\"成龍拍《簡單任務》。（《警察故事4簡單任務》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146085782541307904438526.jpeg/rXnFHNNmxtEThpV1eTbeFJsNx90Rg5Y3g1R5GINUeRg\"/><figcaption>成龍拍《簡單任務》。（《警察故事4簡單任務》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"成龍和洪金寶（微博@成龍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151217031492931584752139.jpeg/kahqJimZhG6MXhcsHfonEiyn4s0nqt7XC-L4igvi-Io\"/><figcaption>成龍和洪金寶（微博@成龍）</figcaption></figure><p>成龍狂食煎炸嘢眼皮浮腫</p><p>成龍早前在社交平台分享哈爾濱工作Vlog，他自稱為「50後高能量男生」，的確成龍成程笑容滿面，精力充沛。成龍分享食飯片段，從片段中可見，桌上擺滿了煎炸食物，且有一大碗濃湯麵，擺了多種醬料，成龍「暴風吸入」重咸食物，絲毫不打算養生，食得十分滋味，不過他食了幾嚿後便不食，請在場人士食。成龍之後派甜品朱古力，食得非常好。片段中成龍眼皮浮腫，露出眼袋，難掩疲倦，相信行程忙碌，然而他在台上仍然開朗，專業完成工作。</p><figure><img alt=\"成龍哈爾濱工作。（小紅書@成龍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173707658650324992926358.png/C-5TD6MmznCZVariLVGxmUEuI3s7V3P73CZOpNwmTqQ\"/><figcaption>成龍哈爾濱工作。（小紅書@成龍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「暴風吸入」煎炸嘢。（小紅書@成龍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173707655684820992183796.png/_b00ul1ZYuc_KoZmImPLwIpi3oaCi88vWa4OOVmuDjk\"/><figcaption>「暴風吸入」煎炸嘢。（小紅書@成龍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"油膩嘢！（小紅書@成龍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173707668813516800310827.png/c-6NlinoalFzef90dVGU9q8f9Efy07-NjeL0lY3i9JU\"/><figcaption>油膩嘢！（小紅書@成龍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"之後又派朱古力。（小紅書@成龍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173707666556850176685743.png/kZIECTJO8t8SKcQL7TG59Bk6ToRkvCH6RnZ2kUZ2dpE\"/><figcaption>之後又派朱古力。（小紅書@成龍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"成龍眼皮浮腫，難掩疲倦。（小紅書@成龍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173707664035942400456018.png/Q9O4CT5CNNngDe2WHWCquZYrbtQRnLfkDhjv8g4Y7_I\"/><figcaption>成龍眼皮浮腫，難掩疲倦。（小紅書@成龍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不過笑容開朗。（小紅書@成龍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173707661867356160567938.png/b5ae4BT-LWLaGvdVaRnQA4JK8l1YzaSbkb7oIZG-6CE\"/><figcaption>不過笑容開朗。（小紅書@成龍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"成龍是高能量之人。（小紅書@成龍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173707659530997760163709.png/SFQ-WcAwC8jdV88Aw7sG93-tkNXPd279g2pJ04NqSdM\"/><figcaption>成龍是高能量之人。（小紅書@成龍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"成龍見到狄龍。（小紅書@成龍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173712562693869568457081.png/qCo0QyRoMnb-4NYYEn3sGnspGbr9cbmwpIUELKSFBCw\"/><figcaption>成龍見到狄龍。（小紅書@成龍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慶祝成家班50周年。（小紅書@成龍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173712560114241536108753.png/8EHeMqDXRbbTEhtHLx-SGxQQQjySTiiq5LZn2uS2Z9o\"/><figcaption>慶祝成家班50周年。（小紅書@成龍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好多人。（小紅書@成龍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173712557626888192218630.png/5a7GWHc8biEaydtV2G4CN6CNMFOk-TT2vP4L5rz-C-Y\"/><figcaption>好多人。（小紅書@成龍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"自稱「高精力男孩」。（小紅書@成龍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173712555210838016748106.png/JvTCm8GfuRHfCM7DDlQr2gXq3gQoBEAyu59aCbufWgk\"/><figcaption>自稱「高精力男孩」。（小紅書@成龍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"50後高能量男生。（小紅書@成龍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173712552660570112297653.png/2eie4DjUc5BI5ndUnhPyjtpogKal2MDH6NmVyOjZlcg\"/><figcaption>50後高能量男生。（小紅書@成龍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"成龍在自我介紹影片中，激罕自揭患有ADHD。（成龍小紅書截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173708446462119936250316.jpeg/FXkJGri5YBMaDJyFo2HLCb9PKkyu7j4J0MggBdDIIAU\"/><figcaption>成龍在自我介紹影片中，激罕自揭患有ADHD。（成龍小紅書截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T22:18:27.583023+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":658,"images":15,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}